# Player tank sprite, 12x12 MODE 1 pixels (6x6 superpixels).
#
# Legend:  .  transparent (the arena shows through)
#          p  the player's ink
#          o  the player's contrast ink (black for C, M and Y; yellow for K)
#
# Only facings E and NE are drawn here. The other six are exact clockwise
# quarter turns of these: N, S and W from E; SE, SW and NW from NE.
#
# Preview every player, facing and background with:
#     uv run dd-preview-sprites     (writes build/design/sprites.png)

